<title>USA: Virco Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Virco Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended	 Year Ended</p>
<p>				     January 31	   January 31</p>
<p>				 (In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>				    1997     1996	 1997     1996</p>
<p> Sales			  $47,160 $46,614   $236,277 $224,349</p>
<p> Net Income		     2,320   2,263	9,326    5,209</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share	  0.39    0.38	 1.55     0.87</p>
<p>Note:  Per share data based upon weighted shares outstanding:</p>
<p>6,024,180 for three months ended January 31, 1997</p>
<p>6,004,835 for the year ended January 31, 1997</p>
<p>5,985,864 for the three months ended January 31, 1996</p>
<p>5,974,739 for the year ended January 31, 1996</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for 1995 reflected $1,000,000 of non-recurring pre-tax earnings applicable to the insurance recovery for tornado damage at the Company's Arkansas facility and the resolution of an environmental claim by Virco relating to its North Carolina plant.  One half of this non-recurring gain was realized in the fourth quarter of that year.</p>
